ile_path\":\"\\u003crepo\\u003e/internal/doctor/archetype_check_test.go\",\"new_string\":\"\\t// C1: a load error that is NOT \\\"not found\\\" (malformed YAML, here) must\\n\\t// not be swallowed as \\\"not deploy..."}
